WEBVTT

00:00:00.710 --> 00:00:06.822
Good afternoon, we are here at day three of the
CIDESCO World Congress 2026 and we

00:00:06.822 --> 00:00:09.281
have Amit here from Portion Pack.

00:00:09.281 --> 00:00:13.828
Amit, you've just taken the 90-second
Digital Wellness Reset.

00:00:13.828 --> 00:00:18.896
Could you tell us a little bit about how
you felt and your thoughts

00:00:18.896 --> 00:00:23.576
and what cybersecurity message you took
away from this experience?

00:00:23.576 --> 00:00:29.532
Yes, it was a mind-opener experience with the
presentation that I've just been into.

00:00:29.532 --> 00:00:32.156
It clearly tells me not to overreact,

00:00:32.550 --> 00:00:37.011
not to fall into any false promises or
anything that you are unaware of.

00:00:37.011 --> 00:00:42.029
And sometimes when we are not aware of a
particular situation or a scenario, it's

00:00:42.029 --> 00:00:47.047
always good to have a second opinion from your
friend or family or someone with a

00:00:47.047 --> 00:00:50.888
little bit of knowledge about this
particular scam or product.

00:00:50.888 --> 00:00:56.092
Thank you. Thank you so much. I appreciate you
coming by our booth and experiencing

00:00:56.166 --> 00:00:59.465
the Digital Wellness Reset.
Really appreciate it.

00:00:59.465 --> 00:01:00.138
Thank you.

00:01:00.486 --> 00:01:01.536
Thank you. You're welcome.
